// probe: stated
// about: a borrowed argument's window closes when its call, render or comparison is done, at every position, before the rest of the statement; an accessor's argument stays open across its lend (SL-855)
// stage 0: cannot parse a `borrow` prefix
// speeds: -O0 -O2
// leaks: none
// prints: plain
// prints: pro
// prints: look abc
// prints: epi
// prints: after
// prints: pro?
// prints: look abc
// prints: epi?
// prints: after
// prints: pro
// prints: bump
// prints: epi
// prints: after
// prints: pro?
// prints: bump
// prints: epi?
// prints: after
// prints: method argument
// prints: pro
// prints: look_m abc
// prints: epi
// prints: after
// prints: pro?
// prints: look_m abc
// prints: epi?
